Build id -> cache version: the normal build writes `.next/BUILD_ID=99abf29`; an alternate
build with `NEXT_PUBLIC_BUILD_ID=verify-abc123` writes `.next/BUILD_ID=verify-abc123` and the
value is inlined into the client bundle that registers `/sw.js?v=<build id>` (see offline block).

